{"body":{"text":["Reading Knowledge as text takes about a quarter of a second at the command line over the five stores, where it took 0.8 s while every word was a holon (19/49). A brief is read in one read, by `sections`, a function written in the language upon the natives: a brief and the briefs it holds as sections, each a whole entering no brief, which the brief component applies, where it read a whole for every brief, level by level (20/16). A read learns what it applies before working it out, a layer at a time from the expression it carries, each layer one question of every store, where it learned one holon at a time; and a kind of value is told by its type alone, a kind's name and an empty mould, so it is never searched for (20/14, 20/16). A brief's whole so takes six rounds to the stores where it took twelve (20/16), about three of them learning what it applies, the first shared with its data, every read again; in the browser, once the field is fetched, a move to a brief settles in 60 to 116 ms where it took 155 to 1,269 (20/16). The engine's whole asking each store its whole as one question was built again and measured: beside the brief's one read it came within about 10 ms of the layered whole, so it stays let go (19/73, 20/14). The engine still lets go of what a use gives beyond what its function takes, without a word, which is to be refused, since nothing is to fail silently (19/39). Still between: `language/text.ts` keeps the earlier form of expressions for its own tests alone. *The read's shape the session's, at the author's word that things be as simple as possible (20/15); built.*"]},"id":"1M83RT7TJHTV000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["**The chassis broken away:** the chassis abstracted from the components it draws, a module of its own, the components a package standing on it, and the interface no module but a program, glue let go as it is met (20/18, 20/19). *The step the author's, 20/19: \"first off, it's definitely breaking away the chassis\"; its shape the session's (20/18), agreed.*"]},"id":"1M83RT7TJHTV001","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**The chassis broken away:** the chassis abstracted from the components it draws, a module of its own, the components a package standing on it, and the interface no module but a program, glue let go as it is met (20/17, 20/19). *The author's, 20/19: \"first off, it's definitely breaking away the chassis\".*"]},"id":"1M83RT7TJHTV002","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Fewer passes to the stores:** \"I would thikn it shouldn t need many passes to the store if we have the right native vocabulary\" (19/72). A brief is now read in one read, and what a read applies learned a layer at a time, six rounds where there were twelve (20/16); it is still learned every read, about three rounds, and knowing it across reads would be the engine keeping something, a deeper discussion the author set apart: \"architecturally, that's not what we drew\" (20/11). *Open.*"]},"id":"1M83RT7TJHTV003","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
