{"body":{"text":["Whether natives are the engine's alone or the stores', the author asked, the language having to stay one (20/9). The session proposed a native declared once in the field and realized by each engine by its id, as a component is by each chassis, stores bringing functions written in the language and never code beneath it (20/10, 20/12, 20/14); and the language a module the stores depend on and the engine consumes, as the author put it: \"The store can depend on language. The engine can consume.\" (20/11). *Open: the thread Who declares the natives.*"]},"id":"1M83RT7TJHTV00C","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}